		{
			"type": "Line",
			"value": " A hugged sole parameter keeps the object type's authored expansion.",
			"start": 20,
			"end": 90
		},
		{
			"type": "Line",
			"value": " Two parameters: no hug, so both formatters keep the expansion.",
			"start": 532,
			"end": 597
		},
		{
			"type": "Line",
			"value": " An object PATTERN carries no authored break of its OWN in either formatter.",
			"start": 663,
			"end": 741
		},
		{
			"type": "Line",
			"value": " But an object-TYPE annotation on that pattern is inside the divergence, and the break it",
			"start": 783,
			"end": 874
		},
		{
			"type": "Line",
			"value": " keeps carries into the pattern beside it — which is what prettier itself does at every",
			"start": 876,
			"end": 965
		},
		{
			"type": "Line",
			"value": " position where it keeps the group (add a second parameter and prettier prints this shape).",
			"start": 967,
			"end": 1060
		}
